   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">virtual <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html\">ara::core::Future</a>&lt; void &gt; Validate (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_diag_ara_diag_fbd60d.html#SWS_DM_01821\">SovdRequestMethod</a> request Method, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_diag_MetaInfo_818707.html\">MetaInfo</a> &amp;metaInfo) noexcept;</pre>",
